  },
  {
   "id": "majotori-22023@2.1.0",
   "gameId": "majotori-22023",
   "displayName": "Update 2.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2017-09-11T13:32:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's probably not something that most of you would want to use, and it works a bit like a hack, but some of you were asking for it and it might allow you some fun moments with your friends, so in this update we added the possibility to override Majotori's questions with your own.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "How does it work?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) Create a .txt file called \"custom_questions\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "2) Fill it with questions using this format",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Question",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Correct answer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Incorrect answer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Incorrect answer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Incorrect answer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Place the file in either the folder where the Majotori executable is or in this OS specific one:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Windows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "%USERPROFILE%/AppData/LocalLow/Majorariatto/Majotori/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OSX",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "~/Library/Application Support/unity.Majorariatto.Majotori/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Linux",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "~/.config/unity3d/Majorariatto/Majotori/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "4) That's it! Run the game and it will override the questions with the ones in that file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "For more details refer to the readme. You can access it online here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you have any doubt or problem, you can reach us on the Steam forums or send us an email at contact@majorariatto.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
